graph TD
  P[Approved plan<br/>tasks grouped into chunks] --> A{Human approves<br/>chunk list?}
  A -- no --> P
  A -- yes --> S1[Snapshot before<br/>chunk-N-before.diff]
  S1 --> I[Dispatch implementers<br/>one per task, model by risk]
  I --> S2[Snapshot after<br/>chunk-N.diff]
  S2 --> SG{Static gate<br/>tsc · lint · tests · revert check}
  SG -- fails, round zero --> I
  SG -- clean --> L{Low risk?}
  L -- yes, no review --> REP
  L -- no --> R[Task reviewer<br/>routes diff to rubrics<br/>+ observability pass on backend]
  R --> F{Findings?}
  F -- yes, max 3 rounds<br/>5 on high risk --> X[Fix implementer +<br/>scoped re-review]
  X --> F
  F -- clean --> C{High risk?}
  C -- yes --> M[Cross-model review<br/>second model family]
  C -- no --> REP
  M --> REP[Chunk report<br/>proof + changes, under 20 lines]
  REP --> W{Human says}
  W -- next --> S1
  W -- fix thing --> X
  W -- redo --> U[git apply -R snapshot<br/>re-dispatch]
  U --> S2
  W -- stop --> H
  W -- last chunk approved --> T[Whole-tree review<br/>spec then code +<br/>cross-model, once]
  T --> H[Hand off:<br/>working tree, nothing committed]
